You added the skill "pdf" to the workspace skills folder, so it is not in the skill catalog above. You changed the skill "slides" in the workspace skills folder, so any catalog entry above describes an older version. \`load_skill\` accepts these names; load one to work from its current instructions rather than from what you remember writing.
</instrument-system-note>",
  "stoppedByAgent": "The conversation that started this task stopped this. Do not run it again unless it asks.",
  "stoppedByUser": "The user stopped this. Do not run it again unless they ask.",
  "timeZoneRegion": "Central European Time",
  "unanswered": "This call was stopped before it returned: it never ran, or was interrupted while it ran.",
